<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:30:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>奥驰亚研究卷烟制造商帝国品牌的交易</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands</link><description>奥驰亚集团公司正在研究一项收购英国卷烟制造商帝国品牌公司的潜在交易，这将是十年来对英国公司最大的收购之一。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands'&gt;奥驰亚研究卷烟制造商帝国品牌的交易&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Altria, Japan Tobacco Explore Takeover of Imperial Brands&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/altria-studies-deal-for-cigarette-maker-imperial-brands</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:08:53 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着家庭债务飙升，巴西收紧消费贷款规则</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/brazil-tightens-consumer-lending-rules-as-household-debt-soars</link><description>由于巴西总统路易斯·伊纳西奥·卢拉·达席尔瓦对家庭债务飙升越来越担忧，巴西央行公布了遏制消费者过度借贷的措施。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/brazil-tightens-consumer-lending-rules-as-household-debt-soars'&gt;随着家庭债务飙升，巴西收紧消费贷款规则&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Brazil Tightens Consumer Lending Rules as Family Debt Soars&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/brazil-tightens-consumer-lending-rules-as-household-debt-soars</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:54:50 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>瑞士资本前景黯淡，瑞银誓言保持全球地位</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ubs-vows-to-remain-global-as-swiss-capital-outlook-darkens</link><description>瑞银集团(UBS Group AG)最高领导层本周致信员工，试图向他们保证，瑞士不断加强监管的努力不会夺走该银行数十年来努力打造的东西——真正的全球业务。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ubs-vows-to-remain-global-as-swiss-capital-outlook-darkens'&gt;瑞士资本前景黯淡，瑞银誓言保持全球地位&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：UBS Vows to Remain Global as Swiss Capital Outlook Darkens&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ubs-vows-to-remain-global-as-swiss-capital-outlook-darkens</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:08:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Global Stocks Climb as AI Trade Mounts a Comeback: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>刚果黄金交易商计划建设两座产能 68 吨的精炼厂</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/congo-gold-trader-plans-two-refineries-with-68-ton-capacity</link><description>刚果民主共和国的国家黄金贸易商计划建造两座产能为 68 吨的精炼厂，因为该国希望遏制走私并从其贵金属储备中获得更多利润。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/congo-gold-trader-plans-two-refineries-with-68-ton-capacity'&gt;刚果黄金交易商计划建设两座产能 68 吨的精炼厂&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Congo Gold Trader Plans Two Refineries with 68-Ton Capacity&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/congo-gold-trader-plans-two-refineries-with-68-ton-capacity</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 16:15:54 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>